@baseUrl = http://localhost:6688/console

### Get All Chat Messages
GET {{baseUrl}}/chat/messages

### Get Single Chat Message
GET {{baseUrl}}/chat/messages/1

### Create Chat Message
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sender": "user1",
  "receiver": "user2",
  "message": "Hello, how are you?"
}

### Update Chat Message
PUT {{baseUrl}}/chat/messages/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Hello, I am good, how about you?"
}

### Delete Chat Message
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/chat/messages/1